# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the progression at Snap 100 with its first chord's bass held (G5)
# under the next three, a rest among them, then let go (F3 is key 0, G5 26). Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 10
wait 500
tapkey 0
wait 2000
wav held-bass.wav
tapkey 26
wait 500
tapkey 0
wait 2000
key 0 down
wait 1200
shot held-bass.png
key 0 up
wait 2000
tapkey 0
wait 2000
tapkey 26
wait 2000
wavstop
